rator error, leaving the service mixed. I retried the same rollback once, and it completed in us-west and eu-west as well.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for checkout-api. The create call timed out, but the incident was already in the incident list, so I did not open a duplicate. Its summary covers the rollback, the partial failure, and the retry.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollout.", "type": "text"}]}]}